      "level": 1,
      "content": "CI Surface Audit",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "> **Status**: Established > **Date**: 2026-05-17 (updated Stage 1 implementation) > **Branch**: main > **HEAD**: 384e486 > **Scope**: Full inventory of CI, validation, lint, typecheck, schema, receipt, governance, build, and coordination surfaces. > **Stage 1 complete**: 4 missing Tier 1 gates added to ci.yml; 2 stale workflows removed.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-3",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Executive Summary",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Rig Relay has accumulated substantial governance and determinism infrastructure but **no dedicated CI surface design**. Current CI is inherited from mistral-vibe: a single `ci.yml` that runs pre-commit hooks + full pytest suite, plus several stale legacy workflows. New governance subsystems (schemas, receipts, tool hardening, coordination, evidence) have no dedicated CI gating — they only run as undifferentiated parts of the full test suite.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "**Key findings:**",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "1. **Two stale legacy workflows** (`pylint.yml`, `python-package-conda.yml`) run on every push against ancient Python versions using pip/conda — completely redundant with ruff in pre-commit. 2. **Schema validation is absent from CI** — 74 JSON schema files are only validated ad-hoc. 3. **Content-light receipt policy has no CI gate** — the validator exists but isn't automated. 4. **Full pytest suite is slow** (~361 test files) and runs on every PR without path-based scoping. 5. **No `uv lock --check` or `uv sync --locked --dry-run`** in CI — lockfile drift is undetected. 6. **No dirty-workspace check** — the AGENTS.md rules are behavioral, not automated. 7. **Coordination lease health** — no automated stale-lease detection. 8. **validate-tool profiles** exist as design artifacts but have zero CI backing.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
